  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Assistance to 400 households affected by a violent storm in Kasongo, Maniema,  DR Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on the assessment done by our partner Caritas Kasongo, need of NFI-Shelter, food and Wash were identified as top priorites by those affected. Support with NFIs and shelter were their first and mosty urgent needs as we are now starting the rainy season.  This rapid response will be given in timeline less than 45 days usign using a fair approach - 2 fairs will be implemented.</narrative>
  </description>
